  <Docs>
    <summary>
            This activity will fail within its own scope and output a custom error
            message and error code. The error message and code can provided either as
            a string literal or as an expression that can be evaluated to a string at
            runtime. The activity scope can be the whole pipeline or a control
            activity (e.g. foreach, switch, until), if the fail activity is contained
            in it.
            </summary>
